/source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Incorporate boundary checks for joint limits and workspace reachability</span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,1,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,1,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-269\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Animation</b>: Animate joint movements across multiple simulation frames, program simple gripper open/close cycles, and attach the object visually once a successful grasp is confirmed</span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Recommended toolchain: Python combined with Matplotlib for 2D visualization</span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"37,2,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/287cc7e4-e46c-41a0-b890-2655ee812ade.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"><div>\r\n<span data-path-to-node=\"34,0\">Testing kinematic equations and trajectory animations in Python (using libraries like Matplotlib) allows engineers to validate arm behavior before hardware deployment</span><span data-path-to-node=\"34,1\"><span><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"34,2\">.</span>\r\n</div>',24,16,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GSFIv-QZdAk',NULL,'top','2026-10-21 12:52:12'),(11,1,1,'L15.10 — Example Program Logic','L15.10 — Example Program Logic','<span data-path-to-node=\"40,0\">Structuring control software using finite state machines keeps robotic programs organized, modular, and easy to debug</span><span data-path-to-node=\"40,1\" class=\"\"><span><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"40,2\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\">  </sources-carousel-inline>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<response-element class=\"no-md md-has-block-component\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><code-block _nghost-ng-c1404798789=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1404798789-38 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1404798789=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c1404798789-38 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kOTNiYjcwNmNmM2NkOWY2IiwiY182YjQ2ZTM4NzVmNDE0N2U4IixudWxsLCJyY184ZTdmYjI4MmIxYmEyNjM4IixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjRtZaU_cqXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrAQ\" style=\"display: block;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1404798789=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1404798789-38\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1404798789=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c1404798789-38\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1404798789=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1404798789-38\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1404798789=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1404798789-38\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">state = <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"APPROACH\"</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">if</span> state == <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"APPROACH\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">and</span> at_pregrasp_pose:\r\n    state = <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"GRASP\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">elif</span> state == <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"GRASP\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">and</span> grip_confirmed:\r\n    state = <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"LIFT\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">elif</span> state == <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"LIFT\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">and</span> object_clear:\r\n    state = <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"TRANSFER\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">elif</span> state == <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"TRANSFER\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">and</span> at_target:\r\n    state = <span class=\"hljs-string\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\"PLACE\"</span>\r\n</code></pre></div></div></div></code-block></response-element><ul data-path-to-node=\"42\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-271\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Why Use States?</b>: State machines enforce a clear task sequence, simplify debugging, allow for easy integration of timeouts and safety checks, and prevent sprawling, tangled procedural code</span><span data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. This illustrative pseudocode serves as a foundation; real-world hardware implementations require robust sensor feedback and comprehensive safety handling</span><span data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"42,0,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/31d888c6-c315-489a-b593-63e6834be5c3.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div><div>\r\n<span data-path-to-node=\"38,0\">Using finite state machines ensures a clean task sequence, simplifies debugging, and allows robust handling of safety checks and timeouts</span><span data-path-to-node=\"38,1\"><span><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"38,2\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\"> </sources-carousel-inline><br></div>',24,16,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4FaklMNBe3E',NULL,'top','2026-10-21 12:53:34'),(12,1,NULL,'Autonomous Navigation & Optimal Path Planning','Autonomous Navigation & Optimal Path Planning','<p data-path-to-node=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Autonomous navigation and optimal path planning represent the pinnacle of modern robotics and intelligent systems,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> bridging the gap between raw machine perception and purposeful physical movement.</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> At its core,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> autonomous navigation enables a mobile robot,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> drone,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> or autonomous vehicle to determine its position within an environment,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> construct or utilize a map,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> and safely traverse from a starting point to a designated destination without human intervention.</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> By integrating real-time sensor data from LiDAR,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> cameras,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> and inertial measurement units,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> modern systems can continuously interpret their surroundings,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> distinguishing between static terrain features and dynamic,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> moving obstacles in real time.</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">The process relies heavily on a sophisticated hierarchy of algorithms that handle global route generation and local collision avoidance.</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> While global path planners compute the most efficient overall trajectory across a known map using graph-search or sampling-based algorithms—such as </span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"A^*\" data-index-in-node=\"285\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">A^*</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> (A-star),</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> Dijkstra’s,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> or Rapidly-exploring Random Trees (RRT)—local planners dynamically adjust the vehicle\'s speed and steering vectors to react to sudden,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> unforeseen blockers.</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> This seamless interplay ensures that the system not only finds the mathematically shortest or most energy-efficient path,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> but also adapts fluidly to unexpected environmental disturbances without destabilizing its trajectory.</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"3\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">In practice,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> mastering this domain is essential for deploying reliable autonomous systems across diverse industries,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> from automated guided vehicles (AGVs) and mobile robots in smart warehouses to last-mile delivery rovers and autonomous agricultural machinery.</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> As computational efficiency and sensor fidelity continue to advance,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> the ability to plan optimal paths under uncertainty remains a defining challenge that merges control theory,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> artificial intelligence,</span><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> and real-time software engineering.<br></span></p>',24,16,'http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QR3U1dgc5RE',NULL,'top','2026-10-22 05:24:27'),(13,1,12,'L16.1 — Mobile Robot Fundamentals: Kinematics, Motion Models, and Physical Constraints','L16.1 — Mobile Robot Fundamentals: Kinematics, Motion Models, and Physical Constraints','\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-233\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Mobile robot navigation requires a solid understanding of how a vehicle’s mechanical layout dictates its movement in the physical world</span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Before a robot can determine a path from a starting point to a destination, it must maintain a continuous mathematical model of its current state and operate within its physical boundaries</span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><response-element class=\"no-md md-has-block-component\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><code-block _nghost-ng-c3468370740=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3468370740-33 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3468370740=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c3468370740-33 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl84N2ViMWRjNzEwMDk0NWMxIiwiY185MTRkMzJmNDdlM2JjNDhkIixudWxsLCJyY183ODdjNThmY2Y4OTM5ZGZkIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiY_tmP8MyXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgwE\" style=\"display: block;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3468370740=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3468370740-33\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3468370740=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c3468370740-33\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c3468370740=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3468370740-33\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c3468370740=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c3468370740-33 no-decoration-radius\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">                     Kinematic Pose Space\r\n                      +----------------+\r\n                      |   Pose (x, y)  | ---&gt; Global Coordinates\r\n                      | Orientation (θ)| ---&gt; Heading Vector\r\n                      +-------+--------+\r\n                              |\r\n                     Differential Drive\r\n              +------------------------------+\r\n              |                              |\r\n      Left Wheel Speed (v_L)         Right Wheel Speed (v_R)\r\n              |                              |\r\n              +--------------+---------------+\r\n                             |\r\n                   Non-Holonomic Motion\r\n               (Cannot slide sideways: v_y = 0)\r\n</code></pre></div></div></div></code-block></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">1. Mathematical Representation of Robot Pose</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"6\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-234\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">A robot’s state in a 2D plane is defined by its <b data-path-to-node=\"6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Pose</b>, denoted as a vector <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"[x, y, \\theta]^T\" data-index-in-node=\"74\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">[x, y, θ]^T</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">:</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-235\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Position <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"(x, y)\" data-index-in-node=\"9\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">(x, y)</span>:</b> The spatial coordinates of the robot\'s center of mass or tracking origin within a global reference frame</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-236\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Heading/Orientation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"(\\theta)\" data-index-in-node=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">(θ)</span>:</b> The directional angle (usually measured in radians relative to the global x-axis) indicating where the robot is facing</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.\r\nTogether, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"[x, y, \\theta]\" data-index-in-node=\"12\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">[x, y, θ]</span> define the configuration space (C-space) of a 2D planar robot</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,3\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">2. Differential Drive Kinematics</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"9\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-237\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">A common wheel configuration for mobile robots is the <b data-path-to-node=\"9,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Differential Drive</b> system, consisting of two independently powered wheels mounted on a shared transverse axis, along with one or two passive caster wheels for balance</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"10\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Forward Kinematics Equations:</b> If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"v_L\" data-index-in-node=\"33\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">v_L</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"v_R\" data-index-in-node=\"41\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">v_R</span> represent the linear velocities of the left and right wheels respectively, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"W\" data-index-in-node=\"120\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">W</span> is the track width (distance between wheels), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"r\" data-index-in-node=\"172\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">r</span> is the wheel radius:</p><div data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><div class=\"math-block\" data-math=\"\\text{Linear Velocity: } v = \\frac{v_R + v_L}{2}\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/a1871664-7f31-4034-8eec-6e5777c2ecf9.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"></div></div></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-238\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Non-Holonomic Constraints:</b> Differential drive platforms are <b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">non-holonomic</b></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. They cannot exert instantaneous velocity sideways (perpendicular to the drive wheels)</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,3\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. To move laterally, the robot must first rotate to adjust its heading <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"(\\theta)\" data-index-in-node=\"71\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">(θ)</span> before translating forward</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,5\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,6\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">3. Physical, Mechanical, and Environmental Motion Limits</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"12\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-239\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Safe navigation requires integrating the robot\'s physical constraints directly into path planning</span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">:</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"13\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-240\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Speed Limits:</b> Maximum linear speed (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"v_{\\max}\" data-index-in-node=\"36\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">v_{\\max}</span>) and angular velocity (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\omega_{\\max}\" data-index-in-node=\"68\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">ω_{\\max}</span>) constrained by motor power and gear ratios</span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-241\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Acceleration and Inertia:</b> The motor torques limit the rate of linear acceleration (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\dot{v}\" data-index-in-node=\"83\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\\dot{v}</span>) and deceleration</span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Abrupt stopping or turning can induce wheel slip, invalidating dead-reckoning position estimates</span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,3\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-242\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Turning Radius:</b> While differential drive robots can turn in place (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\text{Radius} = 0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\\text{Radius} = 0</span> by setting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"v_L = -v_R\" data-index-in-node=\"96\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">v_L = -v_R</span>), doing so at high speeds requires significant deceleration and increases wear</span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2137671841=\"\" _nghost-ng-c197584763=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" id=\"p-rc_787c58fcf8939dfd-243\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Robot Footprint &amp; Wheel Traction:</b> The geometric shape (bounding circle or polygon) dictates clearance around obstacles, while wheel-ground friction determines slip thresholds on smooth or uneven surfaces</span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2613518143=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c2137671841=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   </sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul>\r\n',24,16,'http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=14xipN7Gx-I',NULL,'top','2026-10-22 05:43:48');
